 st plain social\, wild hippie dancing at concerts.\nStarr also teaches Pri
 vate Tap Lessons for any level dancer. Starr has a studio at her home.\nGa
 be Copeland (pictured with Mindy on flier above)\nGabe has been a dance ed
 ucator for over 20 years. He has performed nationally and internationally 
